OL,3,GNEWSAMore domestic abuse courts needed,
OL,4,Asays MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called for more Specialist
OL,7,FDomestic Abuse Courts [SDACs] to be
OL,8,Festablished across the country "to
OL,9,Fbetter protect victims".
OL,11,FFirst piloted in England and Wales in
OL,12,F1999, SDACs use existing court
OL,13,Ffacilities to streamline domestic abuse
OL,14,Fcases for those involved.
OL,16,FChelmsford Liberal Democrat Marie
OL,17,FGoldman told the BBC that delays in the
OL,18,Fcourt system meant victims were "less
OL,19,Flikely to report crimes".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
