OL,3,GNEWSAMore domestic abuse courts needed,
OL,4,Asays MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) said it
OL,7,Fwas considering expanding specialist
OL,8,Fdomestic abuse courts, and supporting
OL,9,Fvictims was "a priority".
